request.description:
Returns all Google accounts connected to the instance, with their calendars.

Use the returned `account_id` and calendar `name` values when building configs:
```json
{
  "google_calendar_sources": [
    {
      "account_id": "<account_id from response>",
      "calendar_names": ["<name from response>"]
    }
  ]
}
```

Required scope: `read:pdf`

